# DRIFTLINE: the car only drives left and right along the road. Steering
# also swings the gun: it tilts the way you drive, two degrees a frame, to
# at most 45 degrees either side of straight up (a 90-degree cone). Let go
# and the car rolls to a stop with the gun left where it was; UP brings
# the gun back to straight up without moving the car. While you steer, the
# gun follows the steering even with UP held (there is no aim lock).
game driftline
wait 12
press A
cheat nospawn
wait 10
cheat pos 160
expect aim0 == 0
expect x0 == 160
hold RIGHT 10
expect aim0 == 20
expect x0 > 160
hold RIGHT 20
expect aim0 == 45
expect vx10_0 == 20
# let go: it stops, and the gun stays
wait 30
expect vx10_0 == 0
expect aim0 == 45
# UP: three degrees a frame back to straight up, the car stays put
cheat pos 160
hold UP 5
expect aim0 == 30
expect x0 == 160
hold UP 20
expect aim0 == 0
expect x0 == 160
# left swings it the other way
hold LEFT 12
expect aim0 == -24
hold LEFT 40
expect aim0 == -45
wait 30
# UP with the pad steering: the steering wins
hold UP 20
expect aim0 == 0
hold LEFT UP 10
expect aim0 == -20
wait 30
# the road ends at the screen's edges
hold LEFT 200
expect x0 == 12
hold RIGHT 250
expect x0 == 308
# the main gun's shots leave at the gun's angle
cheat pos 160
hold UP 30
press B
expect pshot_vx10 == 0
expect pshot_vy10 == -60
wait 20
hold RIGHT 30
press B
expect pshot_vx10 == 42
